        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Production inventory was derived from detailed literature studies and specifications from the manufacturer, relevant for the European production. Transport specifications of the fertiliser product to the regional department store, which were not included in the reference used for this inventory, were complemented by data given in Patyk &amp; Reinhardt (1997).\n\n# Included processes\nThe unit process inventory takes into account the production of potassium sulphate from potassium chloride and sulphuric acid. Transports of raw materials and intermediate products to the fertiliser plant as well as the transport of the fertiliser product from the factory to the regional department store were included. Production and waste treatment of catalysts, coating and packaging of the final fertiliser products were not included. Infrastructure was included by means of a proxy module.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
